  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 070a5cc867f57534e9ed266187d279e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: First Note
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  HoverText: Worn Note
  ContentText: 'I never imagined the Codex could become this quiet. The Head Scribe
    ordered everyone to report to the containment facility immediately. They said
    the accident was worse than what was initially reported.


    They told me to
    stay behind and catalog what remained. It''s likely they knew no one would come
    back for these books.'
